{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06732","headline":"放歌行 · 王昌龄","name":"放歌行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南渡洛阳津，西望十二楼。\n明堂坐天子，月朔朝诸侯。\n清乐动千门，皇风被九州。\n庆云从东来，泱漭抱日流。\n昇平贵论道，文墨将何求？\n有诏徵草泽，微诚将献谋。\n冠冕如星罗，拜揖曹与周。\n望尘非吾事，入赋且迟留。\n幸蒙国士识，因脱负薪裘。\n今者放歌行，以慰梁甫愁。\n但营数斗禄，奉养每丰羞。\n若得金膏遂，飞云亦何俦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}